  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "How ReConnect databases/core/data_all.json#ebp_reference maps onto therapies.json (the Psychotherapy & EBP registry, crossover brainstorm v2 item #13). Read by sync_from_reconnect.py --dataset ebp and by the registry's build-time validator once one exists. Every upstream key must appear in exactly one of fieldMap or denylist; an unclassified key is reported and fails the run (exit 1). The registry carries the modality, its guideline-graded evidence, format facts and re-authored guidance; local availability is linked, never copied.",
  "status": "DRAFT — awaiting faculty gate G0-E (field triage) and roster ratification. Drafted 2026-09-30 from a direct read of the 56 upstream records (24 keys).",
